{{also|anti-depressant}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|anti|depressant|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɛsənt|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|pharmaceutical drug}} An agent that [[prevent]]s or [[counteract]]s [[depression]].

====Usage notes====
The drug is also sometimes used to treat [[satyromania]] and [[nymphomania]].

====See also====
* {{l|en|fluoxetine}}
* {{l|en|Prozac}}

====Hyponyms====
* See also [[Wikisaurus:antidepressant]]

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|depressogenic}}

